{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your internship at Duck Corp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you'll learn how to use tools and scavenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clear one area of \u200b\u200btrash. Use a shovel and metal detector to find items to complete the task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunsets, greet the dawns to the sound of ocean waves and... don't miss anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk along the shore, collect garbage and find real treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of strange garbage will tell the story of this island, and cleaning the beach will help unlock new locations. With each step, you get closer to a clean coast... and to the main secret of this place.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a metal detector to find garbage in the sand, dig up the sand with a shovel and take the found items for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling garbage unlocks new locations and helps earn money to upgrade tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded tools will help you find treasures in the sand more easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUACK-QUACK-QUACK!!!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117460?t=1761921444","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117460?t=1761921444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117460/a4b3457fe105754a1f766539f49ad3d30d004562/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761921444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117460/a4b3457fe105754a1f766539f49ad3d30d004562/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761921444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your internship at Duck Corp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you'll learn how to use tools and scavenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clear one area of \u200b\u200btrash. Use a shovel and metal detector to find items to complete the task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunsets, greet the dawns to the sound of ocean waves and... don't miss anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk along the shore, collect garbage and find real treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of strange garbage will tell the story of this island, and cleaning the beach will help unlock new locations. With each step, you get closer to a clean coast... and to the main secret of this place.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a metal detector to find garbage in the sand, dig up the sand with a shovel and take the found items for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling garbage unlocks new locations and helps earn money to upgrade tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded tools will help you find treasures in the sand more easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUACK-QUACK-QUACK!!!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Izotope Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3851960","name":"Walk Along The Shore"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117460/7d81c0c24f42d075235741455b4ffc8e928f9836/header.jpg?t=1761921444","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com